<Default><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Default>
<Description>Complex Etheta in M x N matrix. M is the number of phi angles and N is the number of theta angles.</Description>
<HideCondition>(ElementPatternType &lt; 4)</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>15</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PatternDataPhiGrid" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Default><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Default>
<Description>Phi grid in M x N matrix. M is the number of phi angles and N is the number of theta angles. Phi should be [0,360], and the phi interval should be consistent.</Description>
<HideCondition>(ElementPatternType &lt; 4)</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Unit><T>Int</T><D>8001</D></Unit>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>14</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="PatternDataThetaGrid" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Default><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Default>
<Description>Theta grid in M x N matrix. M is the number of phi angles and N is the number of theta angles.  Theta should be [0,180], and the theta interval should be consistent.</Description>
<HideCondition>(ElementPatternType &lt; 4)</HideCondition>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Unit><T>Int</T><D>8001</D></Unit>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>14</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="Phi" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>0</DataEntry>
<Default><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Default>
