<Item XName="READ_ME" UserName="READ_ME" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;SParamDatasetPhaseShifterAtten&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ff0000 size=2&gt;&lt;FONT color=#000000&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;This workspace demonstrates use of S-parameter data in the Phased Array Attenuator (ArrayAttn) and Phase Shifter (ArrayPhase) models.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Since the workspace was saved without simulation data, you may see errors from equations or graphs trying to access datasets from simulations that have not run yet. These errors will go away once you run all simulations in this workspace.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;SETUP&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;S-parameter data for the Analog Devices parts HMC1019ALP4E (5-bit Digital Attenuator) and HMC543ALC4B (4-bit Digital Phase Shifter) have been imported in the folders with the corresponding names (imported S-parameter data is for each state of these devices; 32 states for Attenuator and&amp;nbsp;16 states for Phase Shifter). The graphs under these folders show the S(2,1) magnitude and phase.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The &lt;EM&gt;Designs&lt;/EM&gt; folder has four designs&amp;nbsp;representing (at different levels of accuracy/detail) an 8 x 8 URA system with element spacing set to half a wavelength&amp;nbsp;for a 10 GHz wave (see &lt;EM&gt;Equation1&lt;/EM&gt;)&amp;nbsp;using a Taylor window and pointing the beam at Theta = 25 degrees and Phi = 250 degrees.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignIdeal &lt;/EM&gt;is using an ideal attenuator and phase shifter&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuant &lt;/EM&gt;is using a 5-bit&amp;nbsp;attenuator and a 4-bit phase shifter, whose response is frequency independent&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParams &lt;/EM&gt;is using a 5-bit&amp;nbsp;attenuator and a 4-bit phase shifter, which also use the S-parameter data for the Analog Devices parts described above.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParamsNL &lt;/EM&gt;is&amp;nbsp;the same as &lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParams&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;described above with the addition of nonlinear parameters specified in the the ArrayAttn model. The nonlinear parameters were adjusted to be around the 1 dB compression point of the array.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The following graphs under the &lt;EM&gt;Graphs&lt;/EM&gt; folder compare the attenuations and phase shifts introduced by the ArrayAttn and ArrayPhase in the&amp;nbsp;first three&amp;nbsp;designs&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Attenuation_ArrayAttn1 &lt;/EM&gt;compares the attenuation introduced by the ArrayAttn model in the&amp;nbsp;first three designs.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Attenuation_ArrayPhase1 &lt;/EM&gt;shows the attenuation introduced by the ArrayPhase&amp;nbsp;model in &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParams&lt;/EM&gt;. This attenuation should not vary too much, otherwise the taper introduced by ArrayAttn could be distorted and the desired sidelobe level may not be achieved. ArrayPhase DOES NOT introduce any attenuation in designs &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignIdeal &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;and &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuant. &lt;/EM&gt;Even if the &lt;EM&gt;InsertionLoss&lt;/EM&gt; parameter is set to 1, the insertion loss would be the same for all paths and would not distort the taper&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;PhaseShift_ArrayPhase1 &lt;