ONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Equation &lt;EM&gt;PlotPatterns&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;creates 3-D beam patterns for the four designs so that we can compare the effects of quantization, S-parameters, and non-linearity.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;EXERCISES&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Run all&amp;nbsp;four Phased Array anlyses.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Observe the attenuations and phase shifts introduced by ArrayAttn and ArrayPhase in the three designs (graphs in &lt;EM&gt;Graphs&lt;/EM&gt; folder).&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Run Equation &lt;EM&gt;PlotPatterns&lt;/EM&gt; to see the&amp;nbsp;four beam patterns.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Observe the effects of quantization,&amp;nbsp;S-paramters, and non-linearities in the beam patterns.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Tune the Freq variable to see how the attenuations, phases shifts, and beam patterns change.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Add another frequency in the ArrayPort1 part in design &lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParamsNL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/EM&gt;(set Freq, TxPwrIn, and Phase parameters to arrays with two elements) and observe the intermods in the graph &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;PhaseShifterOutputSpec&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
